    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture hundreds of monsters!</h2><br><strong>Shoko</strong> is a game with waves of enemies to defeat and <strong>Roguelite</strong> elements in a <strong>cute</strong>, <strong>colorful</strong>, and <strong>hand-drawn</strong> universe.<br><br>Embark on the adventure with a net and venture through different areas to discover over <strong>100 different monsters</strong>. The tons of available upgrades will allow you to defeat the game's bosses and complete your bestiary.<br><br>Each captured monster will grant <strong>a unique effect</strong> to the player, enabling them to create <strong>unique and powerful combinations</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>50 different monsters</strong>!<br></li><li> <strong>50 upgrades</strong>!<br></li><li> <strong>5 Bosses</strong> to defeat!<br></li><li> <strong>5 zones</strong> with unique environments!<br></li><li> <strong>5 different types</strong> of monsters!<br></li><li> Switch from manual to automatic mode mid-game!</li></ul>",
